########################################
# 🔐 SECRETS, KEYS & SENSITIVE DATA
########################################

## API Keys and tokens
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
private_key
public_key
secrets.json
secrets.Development.json
secret_token
auth_token
.ssh/

## SSL certificates
*.crt
*.cert
*.cer
*.p7b

## Backup files that may contain secrets
*.bak.bak
backup.json
secrets_backup.json

